---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "stdout_of(easement(&root, &[\"why\", \"domain\", \"http\"]).success())"
---
domain -> http is forbidden (must_not_reach): the domain knows no transport
  but http is open only to shared
domain depends on nothing of http directly; it reaches http through shared:
  src/domain/Order.kt:2 -> src/shared/Retry.kt:2 -> src/http/api/Client.kt
